# Visual QA Sniper — Grand Prize Implementation Plan

## What This Is

**Visual QA Sniper** is a production-grade, autonomous web-testing **platform** that eliminates fragile DOM-based testing forever. It uses a **multi-agent ADK architecture** powered by **Gemini 2.5 Flash** to see web apps visually and test them like a human tester — while you control everything with **your voice** via the **Gemini Live API**.

> **Category Crossover Strategy:** We hit both **UI Navigator ☸️** (primary) and **Live Agents 🗣️** (secondary) simultaneously — maximizing relevance across judging panels and making us a natural candidate for "Best Multimodal Integration" ($5K) *and* the Grand Prize ($25K).

---

## Architecture: Multi-Agent System

```
USER (Voice + Browser)
    │
    ▼
[Next.js Dashboard] ─── WebSocket ───► [FastAPI Backend on Cloud Run]
    │                                         │
    │◄── Screenshot Stream ◄──────────────────┤
    │◄── Action Log ◄─────────────────────────┤
    │◄── Bug Reports ◄────────────────────────┤
    │◄── Voice Response (Audio) ◄─────────────┤
                                              │
                              ┌───────────────┴───────────────────┐
                              │     ADK Orchestrator Agent        │
                              │  (Root agent, delegates tasks)    │
                              └────────┬──────────────────────────┘
                                       │
                   ┌───────────────────┼────────────────────┐
                   ▼                   ▼                    ▼
          [Navigator Agent]   [Bug Hunter Agent]   [Reporter Agent]
         (Clicks / Types /   (Detects overlaps,   (Generates PDF
          Scrolls pages)      contrast failures,   test reports,
                              broken images)       summaries)
                   │
         [Playwright BrowserEngine]
          (Headless Chromium, 1280×720)
                   │
         [Firestore Session Store]
          (Step history, bug log,
           screenshot references)
```

---

## Proposed Changes

### Backend – Python

#### [MODIFY] [main.py](file:///d:/LiveEngine/main.py)
- Two WebSocket endpoints:
  - `/ws/stream` — Main test loop (screenshot → ADK → action → repeat)
  - `/ws/voice` — Gemini Live API bidi-stream for voice control
- Session lifecycle: start/stop/pause/reset
- Streams: screenshot bytes, action JSON, bug JSON, audio bytes

#### [NEW] [vision_engine.py](file:///d:/LiveEngine/vision_engine.py)
- `BrowserEngine` async class (Playwright)
- Methods: `navigate`, `click`, `type_text`, `scroll`, `capture_screenshot`, `record_session`, `close`
- Session video recording using `page.video` (Playwright built-in)

#### [NEW] [agent_tools.py](file:///d:/LiveEngine/agent_tools.py)
- `click_element(x, y)` — Click at pixel coordinate
- `type_text(text)` — Type into focused field
- `scroll_page(direction, amount)` — Scroll up/down
- `take_screenshot()` — Force a screenshot capture
- `flag_visual_bug(description, severity, x, y)` — Log a bug with location
- `check_accessibility(element_description)` — Flag a11y issues
- `mark_test_complete(summary, bugs_found)` — End the session

#### [NEW] [agents/orchestrator.py](file:///d:/LiveEngine/agents/orchestrator.py)
- Root ADK agent that plans the testing strategy
- Delegates to sub-agents based on testing phase

#### [NEW] [agents/navigator.py](file:///d:/LiveEngine/agents/navigator.py)
- Specialised in UI navigation: finds and interacts with elements

#### [NEW] [agents/bug_hunter.py](file:///d:/LiveEngine/agents/bug_hunter.py)
- Specialised in visual QA: looks for layout breaks, contrast failures, broken images, overlapping text

#### [NEW] [agents/reporter.py](file:///d:/LiveEngine/agents/reporter.py)
- Generates structured test report JSON → HTML → PDF

#### [NEW] [session_manager.py](file:///d:/LiveEngine/session_manager.py)
- `SessionManager` wrapping Firestore
- Stores: session metadata, step history, screenshot URLs, bug reports
- Falls back to in-memory dict for local dev

#### [NEW] [report_generator.py](file:///d:/LiveEngine/report_generator.py)
- Takes session history from Firestore
- Generates a full HTML test report (embedded screenshots + bug table)
- Returns as downloadable HTML file

#### [NEW] [voice_handler.py](file:///d:/LiveEngine/voice_handler.py)
- Manages the Gemini Live API WebSocket for voice control
- Receives audio bytes from browser mic → streams to Gemini Live API
- Streams audio response bytes back to frontend
- Voice commands: "start testing", "stop", "go back", "flag that bug"

#### [MODIFY] [requirements.txt](file:///d:/LiveEngine/requirements.txt)
```
fastapi
uvicorn[standard]
google-adk
google-generativeai
playwright
google-cloud-firestore
google-cloud-storage
python-dotenv
weasyprint
Pillow
websockets
```

#### [NEW] [Dockerfile](file:///d:/LiveEngine/Dockerfile)
- Python 3.12 slim base
- Install Playwright + Chromium system deps
- Multi-stage for small final image

