### Infrastructure

#### [NEW] [terraform/main.tf](file:///d:/LiveEngine/terraform/main.tf)
- Enable APIs: Cloud Run, Firestore, Artifact Registry, Cloud Storage
- Firestore database (native, nam5)
- GCS bucket (session screenshots + video recordings)
- Cloud Run service (2 vCPU, 4GB RAM — needed for headless Chromium)
- Artifact Registry Docker repo
- IAM bindings

