### Frontend — Next.js 14 Dashboard

Premium dark-mode glassmorphism design. Judges will be wowed on first look.

#### [NEW] frontend/app/page.tsx
- Hero section with animated gradient
- URL input + natural language goal input
- **Voice Toggle** button — red microphone, streams voice to backend
- Live **screenshot carousel** (updates every agent action)
- **Action Timeline** — scrolling log of every step with icons
- **Bug Report Panel** — cards with severity badges, screenshot thumbnails
- **Download Report** button — triggers HTML report download

#### [NEW] frontend/app/layout.tsx + globals.css
- Inter font, dark color system, CSS variables
- Smooth entrance animations

#### [NEW] frontend/components/ScreenFeed.tsx
- Renders streamed JPEG bytes as a live-updating `<canvas>`
- Click overlay: user can also click directly on canvas to guide agent

#### [NEW] frontend/components/ActionLog.tsx
#### [NEW] frontend/components/BugPanel.tsx
#### [NEW] frontend/components/VoiceControl.tsx
#### [NEW] frontend/lib/useQASocket.ts
- WebSocket hook with exponential backoff reconnect
- Routes messages: `screenshot` → ScreenFeed, `action` → ActionLog, `bug` → BugPanel, `audio` → AudioPlayer

