## Verification Plan

```bash
# 1. Start backend locally
cd d:\LiveEngine
.venv\Scripts\activate
uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8080

# 2. Test WebSocket loop
# Open frontend http://localhost:3000
# Enter URL: https://example.com
# Goal: "Click the More information link"
# Watch live screenshots update + action log fill

# 3. Test voice control
# Hit microphone button → say "go back and try the other link"
# Agent should respond and navigate accordingly

# 4. Test report download
# After session → click Download Report → HTML report with all screenshots + bugs

# 5. Docker build
docker build -t visual-qa-sniper .
docker run -p 8080:8080 --env-file .env visual-qa-sniper

# 6. Terraform deploy
cd terraform && terraform init && terraform apply
# Then push Docker image and update Cloud Run
```
